{"5361870":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Tessera","steam_appid":5361870,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5363670,5363680,5363700,5363710,5363720,5363730,5363740,5363750,5363760,5363780,5363790,5363800,5363810],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tessera is jigsaw, done with craft.<\/h2><br>Most digital jigsaws drop a grid over a photo. Tessera cuts real interlocking pieces, deterministic knob-and-socket seams that lock like the real thing, and lets you choose <i>how<\/i> they're cut and <i>how<\/i> the board is shaped.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cut it your way<\/h2>Seven tab styles (Classic, Straight, Slashes, Ripple, Pebbles, Notch, Dovetail) across four tessellations: the classic grid, hexagons, triangles, and organic Voronoi cells. Pick anywhere from a relaxed few dozen pieces to a marathon 1,000+.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A puzzle every day<\/h2>The daily puzzle is the same for everyone, seeded by the date: build a streak and fill the calendar. Found a great one? Share its seed code and a friend solves the exact same puzzle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Calm, and yours<\/h2>Labelled sorting trays, smooth zoom &amp; pan, a ghost-image reference, a zen no-timer mode, and four warm table themes. Fully keyboard-playable, colourblind-safe, with text-size and reduce-motion options. Soft piano at the table when you want it, with quiet space between the pieces.<br><br><strong>Just puzzles.<\/strong>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tessera is jigsaw, done with craft.<\/h2><br>Most digital jigsaws drop a grid over a photo. Tessera cuts real interlocking pieces, deterministic knob-and-socket seams that lock like the real thing, and lets you choose <i>how<\/i> they're cut and <i>how<\/i> the board is shaped.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cut it your way<\/h2>Seven tab styles (Classic, Straight, Slashes, Ripple, Pebbles, Notch, Dovetail) across four tessellations: the classic grid, hexagons, triangles, and organic Voronoi cells. Pick anywhere from a relaxed few dozen pieces to a marathon 1,000+.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A puzzle every day<\/h2>The daily puzzle is the same for everyone, seeded by the date: build a streak and fill the calendar. Found a great one? Share its seed code and a friend solves the exact same puzzle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Calm, and yours<\/h2>Labelled sorting trays, smooth zoom &amp; pan, a ghost-image reference, a zen no-timer mode, and four warm table themes. Fully keyboard-playable, colourblind-safe, with text-size and reduce-motion options. Soft piano at the table when you want it, with quiet space between the pieces.<br><br><strong>Just puzzles.<\/strong>","short_description":"A calm, craft-first jigsaw game. Feel every piece: seven interlocking cut styles across four board shapes, including grid, hexagonal, triangular, and organic Voronoi, from a few dozen pieces to 1,000+. Daily puzzles, shareable codes, and curated museum masterworks.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5361870\/a535e8ee4e80d8345f99081158b602a432f42e84\/header.jpg?t=1793722800","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5361870\/16f61909e242aa33492cb0dc14ac3fa40dccb435\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793722800","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5361870\/16f61909e242aa33492cb0dc14ac3fa40dccb435\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793722800","website":"https:\/\/tessera.millstrom.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan 1.0 or OpenGL 3.3 capable<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"(c) 2026 Millstrom AB. Included artworks are reproductions of public-domain works from museum open-access collections; sources are credited in-game.","developers":["Millstrom"],"publishers":["Millstrom"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":1025,"final":1025,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"10,25€"},"packages":[1852104],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Tessera","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1852104,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Tessera - 10,25€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":1025}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":64,"description":"Adjustable Text Size"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":15,"description":"Stats"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5361870\/f9eb9297330ce9c22f92a67ea2fbed80c42460f8\/ss_f9eb9297330ce9c22f92a67ea2fbed80c42460f8.600x338.jpg?t=1793722800","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5361870\/f9eb9297330ce9c22f92a67ea2fbed80c42460f8\/ss_f9eb9297330ce9c22f92a67ea2fbed80c42460f8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793722800"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5361870\/459b349c61746955d5b51a0e1f939cd8f1f65810\/ss_459b349c61746955d5b51a0e1f939cd8f1f65810.600x338.jpg?t=1793722800","pa